<mxCell id="70" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align:left;font-size:13px;line-height:1.35;color:#201F1E;font-family:Segoe UI&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;API Management Premium  ·  internal mode  ·  snet-apim 10.10.2.0/24  ·  rg-platform-hub&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Validates the Entra ID token: issuer, audience, tenant id, and roles. Applies the tenant product, quota, and rate limit.&lt;br&gt;Routes /customers, /orders, /catalog, and /integrations to that spoke's private ingress. Forwards correlation id and tenant id.&lt;br&gt;Webhook API verifies the vendor signature and routes only to the integration spoke. Spokes have no public endpoint.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=13;fontColor=#201F1E;fontStyle=0;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;" vertex="1" parent="68"><mxGeometry x="70" y="8" width="3486" height="142" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
